Hi Trinidad,

I see that Antofagasta is one of the regions of Chile <http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Communes_of_Chile>, of which there are 346. (also called communes) Is that what you are looking for? If you want to match each row to one of these 346 regions, could you accomplish your task by looking for each of these 346 names in each element of Titulo?

If so, take a look at the stringr package, especially the function str_match()

HTH, and sorry if I missed the point,
Andrew
